WEBVTT

00:09:27.746 --> 00:09:30.871
And if we can set clear expectations
for our students,

00:09:30.912 --> 00:09:32.996
we can do the same
for our school districts

00:09:33.037 --> 00:09:34.162
and our cities.

00:09:35.079 --> 00:09:37.162
I want to go back to school.

00:09:37.204 --> 00:09:39.621
I can't wait to go back to school.

00:09:39.662 --> 00:09:42.121
I miss the hum of the hallways

00:09:42.121 --> 00:09:46.412
and the weird energy of a room
filling up with sophomores,

00:09:46.412 --> 00:09:47.954
and a better kind of exhaustion

00:09:47.954 --> 00:09:51.579
from putting my heart and my guts
into what I love doing every day.

00:09:52.662 --> 00:09:54.121
But we can't miss this moment.

00:09:54.787 --> 00:09:57.996
We can't let go of the mantra
that we are in this together.

00:09:58.787 --> 00:10:01.579
So don't tell us
what is or isn't possible,